t-[11px] text-gray-500","children":"General Contractor & Project Developer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-brand-orange font-semibold","children":"Kathmandu, Nepal"}]]}]]}],["$","div","r2",{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all flex flex-col justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex text-amber-400 text-xs mb-3","children":"★★★★★"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed","children":["\"","The 4-hour fire rating and sound insulation of Smart Panels provided the quiet, safe environment required for our hospital health post. Exceptional finish and prompt delivery from their Chitwan plant.","\""]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-blue-dark","children":"Khwopa Hospital Health Post Management"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-gray-500","children":"Healthcare Administrator"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-brand-orange font-semibold","children":"Byasi, Bhaktapur"}]]}]]}],["$","div","r3",{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all flex flex-col justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex text-amber-400 text-xs mb-3","children":"★★★★★"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed","children":["\"","Our school classrooms built with Smart Panels stay remarkably cool in the summer heat and warm during winter. The earthquake-resistant certification gives parents complete peace of mind.","\""]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-blue-dark","children":"Bal Bikash English Secondary School"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-gray-500","children":"School Infrastructure Committee"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-brand-orange font-semibold","children":"Libali, Bhaktapur"}]]}]]}],["$","div","r4",{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all flex flex-col justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex text-amber-400 text-xs mb-3","children":"★★★★★"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed","children":["\"","Having Smart Panel listed on the Government District Rate List makes specifying it seamless for municipal and institutional projects. The structural test results and hanging strength exceed standard requirements.","\""]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-blue-dark","children":"Er. Suresh Sharma"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-gray-500","children":"Structural & Civil Engineer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[11px] text-brand-orange font-semibold","children":"Bharatpur, Chitwan"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-10 md:py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-page","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-left sm:text-center sm:max-w-2xl sm:mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-12","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-orange font-bold","children":"Got Questions?"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-1","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"w-16 sm:w-20 h-1 bg-brand-orange sm:mx-auto mt-3 rounded-full"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 text-left sm:text-center w-full","children":"Everything you need to know about Smart Panel specifications, government rates, and factory direct ordering."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"faqs":[{"id":"fq1","question":"What is Smart Panel and what is it made of?","answer":"Smart Panel is a lightweight, interlocking prefabricated panel manufactured by Prefab Panel Nepal Pvt. Ltd. Our flagship panel wraps an EPS beads, cement, sand, and bonding agent core in 4.5mm non-asbestos calcium silicate boards on both faces. Tongue-and-groove edges allow panels to lock together quickly for airtight, fireproof, and insulated construction."},{"id":"fq2","question":"What are the approved Government District Rate List prices for Smart Panel?","answer":"Smart Panel is officially listed on the Government District Rate List with transparent rates: 50mm at NPR 191/sq. ft., 60mm at NPR 293/sq. ft., 75mm at NPR 351/sq. ft., 90/100mm at NPR 410/sq. ft., and 120mm at NPR 495/sq. ft. Standard installation is NPR 26/sq. ft. and accessories are NPR 47/sq. ft."},{"id":"fq3","question":"Where is the Smart Panel factory and corporate office located?","answer":"Our state-of-the-art manufacturing plant is located at Darai Tole-8, Bharatpur, Chitwan, backed by an NPR 20 crore investment with an annual capacity of 150,000 sq. ft. Our corporate headquarters is located at Pepsicola-32, Madhyapur Thimi, Nepal."},{"id":"fq4","question":"Why is Smart Panel superior for earthquake safety in Nepal?","answer":"A lighter wall means significantly less seismic inertial force acts upon the building during ground shaking. Smart Panels reduce wall dead load by over 60%, drastically reducing base shear and structural deflection, making buildings far safer in earthquake zones."},{"id":"fq5","question":"What are the differences between Smart Sandwich Panel, Solid Panel, and EPS Block?","answer":"Smart Sandwich Panels feature smooth 4.5mm calcium silicate board skins on both sides and require no plastering. Smart Solid Panels are mesh-reinforced for added impact resistance and plastered after installation. Smart EPS Blocks are lightweight blocks (100/150/200 × 200 × 600mm) used for partition walls and floor infills."},{"id":"fq6","question":"What tools are needed for on-site Smart Panel installation?","answer":"Installation requires no heavy cranes. A crew uses five standard tools: Cutting Machine (clean trims), Drill Machine (fast fixings), Welding Machine (frame & joint securing), Thread Hand Drill (fine adjustments), and Plumb Bob (ensures panels are perfectly vertical)."},{"id":"fq7","question":"How fire-resistant and soundproof is Smart Panel?","answer":"Smart Panels have a certified fire proof time limit of ≥3 hours (for 50mm) and ≥4 hours (for 75mm, 100mm, and 120mm). Sound insulation capacity ranges from ≥35 dB to ≥45 dB, providing high acoustic privacy."},{"id":"fq8","question":"How can I order or become an authorized dealer for Smart Panel?","answer":"You can contact our direct sales hotlines at +977-9851149804 or +977-9709084173, email info@prefabpanelnepal.com, or fill out the dealership application form on our website. We provide factory-direct pricing, technical training, and protected territories."}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-brand-blue text-white py-12 border-t border-brand-blue-dark","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-page flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300 font-bold","children":"Let's Build a Smart Tomorrow"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1","children":"Ready to Order or Inquire About Smart Panels?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 mt-2","children":"Contact our sales hotline: +977-9851149804 / +977-9709084173 or email info@prefabpanelnepal.com"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-3 shrink-0","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"tel:+9779851149804","className":"bg-ambe